/// The platform, its transcript and its collections namespace are values
/// (§3.1.1): stateless but for what the module they belong to was handed,
/// so any two of a kind are equal and, a value having no identity,
/// identical. A program holds only the ones it is handed: the platform
/// hands out none of its module's classes, so it makes no second of a
/// kind, and `crates/ns-runtime/tests/platform.rs`'s
/// `the_platform_and_its_parts_are_values` compares second ones the host
/// makes.
class PlatformValues = Object new () (
  public main: platform args: arguments = (
    |
      t
    |
    t:: platform transcript.
    t
        show: (t == platform transcript) printString;
        newLine.
  )
)
